<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<sample title="Usc Structures">
	<sdk_desc>Exposing <i>C++</i> structs to <i>UnigineScript</i> using the <i>Interpreter</i> class.</sdk_desc>
	<desc>
		<brief>
			<para>This sample demonstrates how to expose <ui>C++</ui> structs to <ui>UnigineScript</ui> using the <ui><link to="interpreter_class">Interpreter</link></ui> class.</para>
			<para>It defines a simple <ui>C++</ui> structure <ui>MyVector</ui> with four float fields (<ui>x, y, z, w</ui>) and registers it. Each field is mapped via explicit getter and setter methods to allow full read/write access from the <ui>UnigineScript</ui> side.</para>
		</brief>
	</desc>
	<tags>
		<tag>UnigineScript</tag>
	</tags>
</sample>
